{"v":4,"catch":"人類的最後一戰即將到來。","desc":"“LIGHTNING FIGHTERS”是1990年由“KONAMI”發行的射擊遊戲。\n裝有等離子波武器的“SUPER FIGHTERS”和無人輔助戰鬥吊艙“TRIGON”作為人類最後的王牌發動戰鬥，以擊退外來文明的入侵。\n這款KONAMI傑作特別為您中的滾動射擊遊戲玩家帶來回報。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2020-08-20","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9a5d44f40bf1a39add195bf9d5ebc35a9270979921e65511517c8f4bb18671f7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b2b49e62993cd7bc87ae13a7f28ab7e0390c598885a8460afbc6dd2121fc2330.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/554361cbf4a8525cf813748b41e93eb443c3c852115c8974df3f255eb752d639.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cf4383680e801f612976cd382affe78cdf52f9446d64cc6852288dc3a96685c5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/303cac99266a256b098d962aac411d1b5dededb17348b0d7e1da48da529ce3ac.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/53498c02cda0f5a7f2b416cd9cd35ce0b7c72dabd11ff4de1512818f07ea3838.jpg"],"titleId":"0100043011cec000","dlc":[]}